  "corrections": [
    "Reject unknown Magic GDS layers and cell-read errors even after exit zero and a zero-DRC result; preserve the complete engine log.",
    "Private MDN.10d operand expands on both axes and remains clipped to actual Poly2; the original 0.16 um minimum/maximum and all other rules remain unchanged.",
    "Remove implicit label joins and reference-driven alignment/simplification/purging. Independently require all body contacts in each domain to share a physical metal network before deriving the common substrate.",
    "Use the native asymmetric MOS extractor, splitting the unchanged source/drain regions by public MVSD/MVPSD drain masks. Preserve distinct D/S in all orientations, W/L and all four junction parameters.",
    "Convert only native model aliases and M/X interface prefixes; preserve measured device terminals and geometry. Netgen performs the independent strict comparison."
  ],
